cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or hardware design, cite the archived release and this project."
title: "NBFM-1 Open BCI Stack"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - name: "NBFM-1 Open BCI Contributors"
abstract: >-
  Open-source multimodal non-invasive BCI architecture combining a causal EEG/MEG fast
  path, asynchronous fNIRS context cross-attention, local-first privacy gating,
  authenticated edge deployment, and a low-cost 128-channel differential TDM EEG
  acquisition architecture.
keywords:
  - brain-computer interface
  - EEG
  - OPM-MEG
  - fNIRS
  - transformer
  - neuroprivacy
  - open hardware
  - defensive publication
license: "AGPL-3.0-only"
